# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Football data providers
#
# None of these are required to run the app: TheSportsDB's public test key is
# used by default, which returns real live scores and real fixtures but caps
# most list endpoints at a handful of rows. Configuring either of the first two
# lifts that ceiling substantially.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# football-data.org — recommended. Free tier covers the top European
# competitions with no result truncation. https://www.football-data.org/client/register
FOOTBALL_DATA_API_KEY=

# API-Football (api-sports.io) — widest coverage, and the only one of the three
# that carries the NPFL and CAF competitions properly.
# https://www.api-football.com/
API_FOOTBALL_KEY=

# TheSportsDB — a paid key removes the public-key result caps.
# https://www.thesportsdb.com/pricing
THESPORTSDB_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI match briefings (optional)
#
# Without this the app writes its match analysis deterministically from the
# fitted model, which is fully functional. With it, Claude rewrites that
# briefing into sharper prose — grounded in the same numbers, never inventing
# statistics of its own.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
